# due-stamps.local — one periodic obligation per line, TAB-separated:
# <label>	<stamp path>	<period in hours>	[<anchor ERE>]
# Paths are absolute or start with ~ (relative paths are not resolved).
# The stamp file holds a UTC instant written by the routine itself: date -u +%FT%H:%MZ
Security sweep	~/.config/myteam/lanes/myproject/last-sweep	24
Housekeeping	~/code/myproject/docs/.housekeeping	168
# A stamp kept inside a log: name the line that records a full run.
# Security sweep	~/code/myproject/docs/security-log.md	24	^Swept:
